	<body bgcolor="#ffffff" text="#000000">
		<h1 class="largetext">Rodcetnife.org Forums</h1>
		<h2 class="normaltext">General Category => General Discussion => Topic started by: Colleen on August 19, 2005, 11:57:24 am</h2>

		<table width="90%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
			<tr>
				<td>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>InnerLoop aka Unity Of Knights</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Colleen</b> on <b>August 19, 2005, 11:57:24 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I wanted to let everyone know that ALOTof key players have disbanded from Unity of Knights.&nbsp; The reason I left is that I didnt want to be the last toon to disband like I did with 4 other guilds.&nbsp; We lost alot of our tanks which meant we couldnt raid like we use too.&nbsp; Also this past Monday the lack of officers that were on was a major factor. It was a great run for Inner Loop aka Unity of Knights but its time to move on to bigger and better things.&nbsp; To all the members of Inner Loop I will miss you and i will try and keep in touch!&nbsp; That was the bad news is now this post needs some good news!&nbsp; Warlords of Quellious is the new guild in town and we are gonna BRING THE HOUSE DOWN!<br /><br />See ya all online!!<br /><br />Colleen Quickness</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: InnerLoop aka Unity Of Knights</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Soupy Sales</b> on <b>August 19, 2005, 01:04:49 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">Warlords of Quellious is the new guild in town and we are gonna BRING THE HOUSE DOWN!<br /></div><br /><br />this sounds vaguely familiar.</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: InnerLoop aka Unity Of Knights</b><br />
					Post by: <b>HandySolo</b> on <b>August 19, 2005, 01:51:45 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Rofl, I bet it does.&nbsp;  :)</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: InnerLoop aka Unity Of Knights</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Zerxes</b> on <b>August 19, 2005, 03:53:45 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Colleen $txt[176] August 19, 2005, 11:57:24 am</div><div class="quote">Warlords of Quellious is the new guild in town and we are gonna BRING THE HOUSE DOWN!<br /><br />See ya all online!!<br /><br />Colleen Quickness<br /></div><br /><br />Dang, I was hoping for another guild that was gonna bring this server to its knees&nbsp; :dissappointed:</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: InnerLoop aka Unity Of Knights</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Fartek</b> on <b>August 19, 2005, 05:26:04 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">hmmm Lemme see... IL is formed... Wari ends up GL or co GL or something.. wari leaves.. wari comes back.. no one likes wari.. Wari disbands IL<br /><br />Unity of Knights forms as an anti wari guild...<br /><br />Wari with his bots forms some gay guild... it dont work.. wari leaves it<br /><br />Wari then gets a few friends and forms Warlords of Quellious...<br /><br />now people leaving Unity of Knights.. the anti Wari guild.. and joins Wari&#039;s guild.. which he is atleast an officer of...<br /><br /><br />wow and i thought Quellious was funny<br /></div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: InnerLoop aka Unity Of Knights</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Colleen</b> on <b>August 19, 2005, 06:28:21 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Fartek&nbsp; Hey what can I say its all DRAMA.... UOK was disbanded by its co leader ( not naming names).&nbsp; This all happened this morning....&nbsp; I am very sad but this is a game and its all about progression.&nbsp; <br /><br /><br />Colleen Quickness</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: InnerLoop aka Unity Of Knights</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Feitmere</b> on <b>August 21, 2005, 11:03:05 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Colleen $txt[176] August 19, 2005, 06:28:21 pm</div><div class="quote">this is a game and its all about progression.&nbsp; <br /></div><br /><br />A lot of people consider this game more than just progression, but you pay your monthly subscription, so you play the game how you want to.</div>
					<br />
